WEBVTT

00:36.330 --> 00:37.790
Not yet.

00:43.960 --> 00:45.790
I need to get stronger.

00:49.000 --> 00:50.880
Must get more...

00:52.170 --> 00:53.580
More power!

01:26.750 --> 01:28.670
That was close, huh?

01:30.040 --> 01:32.960
You gotta be alert during battles.

01:33.540 --> 01:35.250
Like me.

01:35.630 --> 01:37.460
Right, Ragna?

01:39.500 --> 01:41.210
Thank you, Leo.

01:43.040 --> 01:44.210
Eh?

01:47.750 --> 01:49.000
Bzzt!

01:49.000 --> 01:51.420
Wrong, Ragna.

01:51.420 --> 01:54.630
What are you supposed to do
when you praise me?

02:01.580 --> 02:04.040
Thank you, Leo.

02:05.750 --> 02:08.250
That's just what partners do!

03:46.380 --> 03:47.380
Dragons.

03:48.880 --> 03:52.420
Creatures with an ancient, magical bloodline.

03:53.330 --> 03:56.460
The natural enemies and predators of humankind.

03:58.000 --> 04:00.210
There are two ways to kill a dragon.

04:01.540 --> 04:06.250
You can freeze their blood with silverine,
an aura that emits from silver weapons.

04:07.960 --> 04:09.250
Or...

04:10.830 --> 04:12.580
Their bodies can be incinerated by sunlight.

04:20.540 --> 04:21.670
All right!

04:23.040 --> 04:25.670
Another quest in the books!

04:26.040 --> 04:28.170
Let's head back, Ragna.

04:28.580 --> 04:29.580
Okay.

04:30.330 --> 04:34.250
<b>Ep 01: The Day the Reaper Was Born</b>

04:34.250 --> 04:37.580
<b>City in the Kingdom of Lese</b>

04:34.250 --> 04:37.580
<b>Ronabera</b>

04:40.630 --> 04:42.460
That scar on her face...

04:42.790 --> 04:44.580
That's Leonica, the prodigy!

04:44.580 --> 04:47.540
They say she's killed
thirty dragons all by herself.

04:47.540 --> 04:49.210
I heard she killed fifty.

04:49.210 --> 04:51.330
But she's so tiny...

04:54.880 --> 04:57.790
<b>Guildhall</b>

04:56.080 --> 04:59.880
Those who take on quests to
kill dragons threatening people

04:59.880 --> 05:03.500
and make their living by doing so
are called "dragon hunters."

05:04.040 --> 05:08.830
And out of all the dragons hunters
based in this city, Ronabera,

05:09.210 --> 05:13.080
Leo has killed the most dragons by far.

05:15.040 --> 05:18.830
Even though she's only twelve,
she's a top-notch dragon hunter.

05:20.170 --> 05:24.250
Without a doubt, she'll get
even stronger as she gets older.

05:29.630 --> 05:31.170
Nom nom.

05:33.330 --> 05:34.830
What's wrong, Leo?

05:35.500 --> 05:37.330
I want some meat.

05:38.630 --> 05:41.130
Got it. I'll cook some meat tonight.

05:41.130 --> 05:42.580
Yay!

05:42.960 --> 05:44.830
"The poster child of dragon slaying."

05:45.380 --> 05:47.380
"The girl beloved by the silver sword."

05:48.380 --> 05:52.420
People call Leo these things
with envy and awe.

05:53.330 --> 05:54.500
But...

05:56.170 --> 05:57.670
Leo is...

05:59.460 --> 06:00.920
my hero.

06:01.250 --> 06:03.130
Taking pics again?

06:03.130 --> 06:04.210
Yep.

06:04.710 --> 06:09.420
I'm just so happy I get to keep
a record of your stellar growth.

06:10.630 --> 06:15.130
That'd sound pervy if you were
talking to anyone but me, Ragna!

06:16.670 --> 06:19.630
Aren't you living a charmed life, Ragna.

06:20.210 --> 06:25.460
Must be pretty cushy living off
the Prodigy's table scraps.

06:28.210 --> 06:29.420
Who's that?

06:29.420 --> 06:31.040
Hey! It's me!

06:31.040 --> 06:35.080
I'm Sykes Charluke! I'm ranked second
in number of dragon kills after you.

06:35.080 --> 06:37.790
I've got no clue who you are. Sorry.

06:40.000 --> 06:41.670
Keep your cool, bro!

06:41.670 --> 06:43.580
We've got your back!

06:43.920 --> 06:46.380
Y-yeah, you're right.

06:48.420 --> 06:50.170
Let me start over.

06:52.380 --> 06:57.380
Despite having only below average skills,
the Prodigy teamed up with you.

06:57.380 --> 07:00.210
Do you realize you're only dragging her down?

07:00.540 --> 07:02.330
You're just baggage.

07:02.330 --> 07:04.880
Actually, can you even carry her bags?

07:08.040 --> 07:09.580
You get it?

07:09.580 --> 07:11.380
You cursed bastard.

07:21.210 --> 07:24.210
What is it you seek with your silver blade?

07:24.540 --> 07:27.670
Wealth? Status? Glory?

07:27.670 --> 07:29.500
How badly do you desire it?

07:32.330 --> 07:34.710
I want ultimate strength.

07:34.710 --> 07:36.630
I want to become powerful.

07:36.630 --> 07:38.830
Stronger than anyone or anything.

07:39.170 --> 07:42.790
That's what I thought when I held
a silver sword for the first time.

07:42.790 --> 07:45.210
That's why I became a dragon hunter.

07:45.750 --> 07:49.170
Dragons are the strongest
of all living creatures.

07:50.130 --> 07:53.130
I'll hunt and hunt and hunt dragons!
Relentlessly.

07:53.790 --> 07:57.130
I'll even hunt their so-called Dragon God,
wherever it may be.

07:57.460 --> 08:01.130
I want to prove that I, Leonica,
am the strongest of the strong!

08:01.920 --> 08:05.920
Well, is there anyone who wants to join me?

08:06.460 --> 08:10.330
I'll share all the wealth, status, and glory
with you! However much you want!

08:10.330 --> 08:15.250
Is there anyone out there who will join me
in this bloody life of dragon hunting?

08:18.960 --> 08:20.830
I'll go with you!

08:20.830 --> 08:22.540
For as long as I can.

08:23.040 --> 08:24.750
I want to go with you!

08:27.960 --> 08:29.500
There ya have it!

08:29.500 --> 08:31.710
That's why I like you, Ragna.

08:34.130 --> 08:36.920
I'm getting sleepy.

08:36.920 --> 08:39.420
Let's head home and sleep, Ragna.

08:39.420 --> 08:40.460
Okay.

08:41.880 --> 08:45.210
Leo, you need take a bath
and brush your teeth before bed.

08:45.210 --> 08:48.420
Aww, what a hassle!
Can I just go to sleep?

08:48.420 --> 08:50.830
You can do all the scrubbing.

08:50.830 --> 08:52.130
All right.

08:54.420 --> 08:58.540
You two take baths together?!

09:23.040 --> 09:25.420
I have no dragon-hunting talent.

09:26.290 --> 09:28.880
Even if I trained hard for the rest of my life,

09:29.540 --> 09:31.790
I'd never get near Leo's level.

09:35.880 --> 09:37.710
But I'll definitely...

09:38.830 --> 09:40.380
get eaten...

09:40.920 --> 09:42.920
by a dragon long before then.

09:44.000 --> 09:45.670
That's okay with me.

09:45.670 --> 09:48.880
As long as I can be even just
a little useful to Leo before I die.

09:54.000 --> 09:55.630
You won't.

09:59.290 --> 10:01.210
You'll lose her.

10:17.790 --> 10:20.170
What's... going on?

10:28.500 --> 10:29.880
Leo?

10:30.380 --> 10:31.790
Ragna.

10:36.170 --> 10:38.080
I'm sorry.

10:51.290 --> 10:53.380
Was that a dream?

10:53.380 --> 10:54.880
The time is nigh.

11:16.330 --> 11:18.040
Hey, Ragna.

11:18.040 --> 11:20.290
Why'd you go out of your way to buy meat?

11:21.290 --> 11:22.380
Huh?

11:22.920 --> 11:26.130
Wouldn't it have been fine
to eat at the guildhall?

11:26.130 --> 11:30.210
Ah. Their vegetable offerings are limited.

11:30.210 --> 11:33.630
Who cares? I hate vegetables!

11:33.630 --> 11:34.960
Bleghhhh!

11:34.960 --> 11:36.540
That's why.

11:36.540 --> 11:40.130
The innkeeper is letting me borrow
the kitchen, so I'll cook dinner.

11:40.130 --> 11:42.880
What? You're gonna cook for me?

11:42.880 --> 11:44.670
Well, I want steak today!

11:44.670 --> 11:45.540
All right.

11:45.540 --> 11:47.000
Hooray!

11:47.420 --> 11:50.960
Meat! Meat! Meat!
Maybe I should mash some vegetables<b>
</b>and mix them in with the steak.<b></b>

11:50.960 --> 11:54.420
Meat! Meat! Meat!

11:54.670 --> 11:55.710
Hm?

11:56.460 --> 12:00.710
It'd be awesome to have well-done meat
tomorrow and rare meat the day after that!

12:54.040 --> 12:56.960
<b>Age of the Sun, Year 498</b>

12:54.040 --> 12:56.960
<b>February 23rd</b>

13:07.290 --> 13:09.250
Hey, hey! What's going on here?

13:09.250 --> 13:11.670
Seriously, not a single quest?

13:11.670 --> 13:14.330
Well, there goes our livelihood.

13:16.250 --> 13:17.210
Hm?

13:17.210 --> 13:19.330
Let's take a breather outside.

13:19.330 --> 13:20.420
Okay.

13:24.750 --> 13:28.130
There've been very few dragons lately.

13:28.670 --> 13:30.920
Yeah, you're right.

13:30.920 --> 13:32.210
Hm?

13:34.580 --> 13:38.040
I need to cut your hair soon.
It's getting long.

13:39.000 --> 13:40.330
Huh?

13:46.830 --> 13:48.170
Whoa!

13:50.210 --> 13:52.130
All right. Perfect.

14:01.040 --> 14:02.540
Are you done?

14:04.210 --> 14:06.250
A-almost done.

14:14.830 --> 14:16.170
Ragna!

14:22.670 --> 14:25.000
That dream. Again.

14:30.250 --> 14:33.210
<b>Age of the Sun, Year 498</b>

14:30.250 --> 14:33.210
<b>February 26th</b>

14:59.000 --> 15:00.500
You'll lose her!

15:08.790 --> 15:10.790
Aren't the dragons behaving strangely?

15:10.790 --> 15:14.170
Yeah. They've been like this
for some days now.

15:14.170 --> 15:16.880
It seems like they're migrating
to the east together.

15:16.880 --> 15:20.500
No wonder there were no decent quests.

15:20.750 --> 15:23.170
To the east is...

15:23.710 --> 15:25.380
Donapierru?

15:25.670 --> 15:27.080
That's makes no sense.

15:27.080 --> 15:31.380
That city hasn't been attacked
by dragons in a decade.

15:31.380 --> 15:34.920
I don't know the reason,
but I've heard that's the case.

15:34.920 --> 15:39.460
When I hear Donapierru,
I think of The Silver Chick.

15:39.460 --> 15:42.080
Have you heard of it?
It's a famous pastry shop.

15:42.080 --> 15:46.920
If there are dragons cropping up near there,
we should try it out after hunting, Ragna.

15:47.880 --> 15:49.580
What exactly was that?

15:51.670 --> 15:52.960
A dream?

15:52.960 --> 15:54.750
Was it really just a dream?

15:54.750 --> 15:56.830
I highly doubt it.

15:57.420 --> 16:00.000
And then there's that man.

16:00.540 --> 16:02.960
Is he a vision? A ghost?

16:03.960 --> 16:05.790
I don't think he's either one.

16:07.330 --> 16:08.500
But...

16:10.170 --> 16:11.420
Hey!

16:11.420 --> 16:13.080
Hey, hey!

16:13.080 --> 16:15.080
Hey, dude!

16:17.290 --> 16:18.960
What's wrong?

16:18.960 --> 16:20.750
You really zoned out.

16:21.920 --> 16:25.750
Oh! Was Number Two
being rude to you again?

16:25.750 --> 16:27.460
Huh? Me?

16:27.460 --> 16:29.880
Should I crush him? Can I?

16:29.880 --> 16:31.000
No.

16:34.460 --> 16:36.210
You have bags under your eyes.

16:40.580 --> 16:42.420
Your hands are calloused.

16:43.790 --> 16:47.790
You've been working harder
than you ever have the past few days.

16:49.000 --> 16:50.830
What happened?

16:50.830 --> 16:52.670
Why are you in such a frenzy?

16:53.040 --> 16:54.380
Tell me.

17:02.040 --> 17:03.380
What...

17:04.000 --> 17:06.250
What can I even do for you, Leo?

17:07.920 --> 17:11.330
Besides just taking care of things for you,

17:13.170 --> 17:16.580
how can I actually help you
in a meaningful way?

17:21.000 --> 17:24.460
You know what I thought
the first time we met?

17:25.630 --> 17:26.830
Huh?

17:27.500 --> 17:29.130
That guy...

17:30.540 --> 17:32.580
"We have the potential to attain
the same level of strength, don't we?"

17:32.580 --> 17:33.920
That's what I thought.

17:38.460 --> 17:40.670
That's... Impossible!

17:41.830 --> 17:44.500
I don't have your talent.

17:44.500 --> 17:46.080
Nope, you don't!

17:47.420 --> 17:50.630
You don't have a talent for dragon hunting.

17:50.630 --> 17:53.250
As someone who's a natural genius,
I can vouch for that.

17:53.580 --> 17:57.920
But my genius instincts also tell me
you'll become strong.

18:01.330 --> 18:06.290
I don't know when that will happen
or what the catalyst will be.

18:06.290 --> 18:08.290
I can't predict that.

18:08.710 --> 18:10.130
I can't wait!

18:14.830 --> 18:19.630
I'll protect you until that time comes.

18:24.080 --> 18:26.630
My parents were eaten by dragons
when I was three.

18:28.130 --> 18:30.290
Some of my relatives took me in.

18:31.000 --> 18:32.830
But then they got eaten by dragons too.

18:34.790 --> 18:39.130
A wealthy man bought me,
but then dragons burned down his estate.

18:47.960 --> 18:49.670
It's your fault!

18:49.670 --> 18:51.630
You called the dragons here!

18:51.630 --> 18:54.580
You're working for the dragons, aren't you?

18:54.580 --> 18:56.290
Cursed bastard!

18:57.290 --> 19:00.000
I've been attacked by dragons again and again.

19:00.000 --> 19:02.000
Somehow, I always survive.

19:03.130 --> 19:06.420
Is there anywhere I can live in peace?

19:11.040 --> 19:14.330
Mister, wanna hunt dragons with me?

19:19.750 --> 19:25.040
Having a special link to dragons isn't a
bad thing when you're a dragon hunter.

19:25.040 --> 19:27.750
Especially if you're always able to survive.

19:31.210 --> 19:34.630
So from this day forth,
you're a dragon hunter too!

19:34.630 --> 19:35.670
Whoo-hoo!

19:35.670 --> 19:37.380
W-wait!

19:37.380 --> 19:39.830
I can't! If I'm with you, you'll-

19:39.830 --> 19:41.420
It's not your fault.

19:42.880 --> 19:44.790
The weak die.

19:45.380 --> 19:47.790
Those stronger than the dragons live.

19:48.330 --> 19:51.290
I'm strong, so I won't die.

19:52.420 --> 19:54.330
I'll prove it.

19:55.040 --> 19:56.330
Let's go!

20:15.630 --> 20:17.710
Cr-crap, I knew it...

20:30.670 --> 20:31.920
Phew!

20:32.880 --> 20:35.080
Hey, I lived!

20:37.000 --> 20:39.380
This girl is strong.

20:40.920 --> 20:44.290
There's no way she'll die.

20:45.920 --> 20:48.920
I can't imagine her dying before me.

20:55.040 --> 20:56.790
Hey, Ragna.

20:57.330 --> 21:00.330
Do you still think you're cursed?

21:01.580 --> 21:03.290
I don't think so.

21:04.290 --> 21:06.290
Because you're with me now.

21:08.750 --> 21:13.250
I want to be by your side
until I'm killed by a dragon.

21:14.080 --> 21:17.170
I want to be with you
for as long as possible.

21:19.210 --> 21:21.500
That's all I want.

21:22.750 --> 21:24.460
That's why...

21:36.420 --> 21:38.630
It'll be... soon?

21:40.460 --> 21:43.420
<b>Age of the Sun, Year 498</b>

21:40.460 --> 21:43.420
<b>February 27th</b>

21:46.460 --> 21:47.960
How many dragons?

21:47.960 --> 21:50.130
Do you have more information?

21:50.130 --> 21:51.790
What's going on?

21:52.130 --> 21:54.540
Donapierru has fallen?

21:54.540 --> 21:55.880
How?

21:55.880 --> 22:00.080
Don't they call it the
"City That Needs No Dragon Hunters?"

22:00.080 --> 22:02.170
You over there, Number Two!

22:02.170 --> 22:03.960
Tell me what happened.

22:04.630 --> 22:06.040
It's Sykes!

22:06.540 --> 22:08.540
And I don't know either.

22:08.540 --> 22:11.830
I heard a horde of dragons attacked
when the sun went down,

22:11.830 --> 22:13.790
and there hasn't been any
communications from the city since.

22:13.790 --> 22:14.790
Eh?

22:15.330 --> 22:18.420
The kingdom issued an emergency quest.

22:18.420 --> 22:21.710
Slaughter the dragon horde
that attacked Donapierru.

22:22.290 --> 22:24.420
And don't you tag along, Prodigy!

22:24.420 --> 22:27.170
Otherwise, you'll hog all the glory!

22:29.000 --> 22:30.750
He said he didn't know anything,

22:30.750 --> 22:32.960
but he ended up telling us
all the info we needed anyway.

22:32.960 --> 22:34.960
I guess he's a good Number Two?

22:37.790 --> 22:39.080
Ragna?

22:39.960 --> 22:42.540
You're pale. What's wrong?

22:44.830 --> 22:46.040
Leo...

22:46.580 --> 22:47.830
Hm?

22:47.830 --> 22:49.040
Let's run-

22:49.540 --> 22:50.880
What was that?

22:57.210 --> 22:59.750
There's a fire! The city's burning!

23:06.420 --> 23:08.880
We gotta... run away.

23:13.880 --> 23:15.000
Leo.

23:15.710 --> 23:17.420
We need to get out of here.

23:18.330 --> 23:19.670
Why?

23:20.630 --> 23:23.500
Because you'll d-

23:29.710 --> 23:31.380
Don't worry.

23:31.380 --> 23:33.000
I won't die.

23:34.170 --> 23:35.580
Let's go!

23:36.960 --> 23:38.130
Leo, wait!

23:45.250 --> 23:46.380
Over here!

23:46.380 --> 23:47.250
Get away!

23:47.250 --> 23:48.960
Don't get caught in the fire!

23:48.960 --> 23:49.880
Hurry!

23:49.880 --> 23:51.210
Run, run!

23:51.710 --> 23:52.920
Dragons?

23:54.080 --> 23:55.130
Shit!

23:57.250 --> 23:58.210
Fire!

24:08.040 --> 24:09.040
Damn it!

24:09.040 --> 24:10.210
Push them back!

24:12.790 --> 24:14.130
No way...

24:18.380 --> 24:19.670
Shit!

24:19.670 --> 24:21.670
What the hell is happening?

24:29.380 --> 24:31.920
Hey, are you okay?

24:33.630 --> 24:35.460
You're covered in blood!

24:38.330 --> 24:40.210
Blood is blades.

24:42.920 --> 24:44.500
Blood is flame.

24:52.790 --> 24:55.790
Good day, fine humans.

24:57.710 --> 24:59.380
Now perish.

25:17.290 --> 25:18.750
Those are...

25:25.670 --> 25:26.710
Leo!

25:32.080 --> 25:34.080
No matter what...

25:34.330 --> 25:35.750
I won't let you die!

25:37.380 --> 25:39.670
Huh? Wh-why?

25:40.040 --> 25:42.540
Why is a superior dragon...

25:42.540 --> 25:44.790
in a place like this?

25:46.460 --> 25:48.290
This is bad! I'm gonna die.

25:56.750 --> 25:59.830
If I can just take this guy out,
Leo will be okay!

26:04.580 --> 26:06.290
Blood is flame.

26:13.290 --> 26:14.500
Damn it!

26:19.040 --> 26:20.710
That moron!

26:21.210 --> 26:23.170
Sykes! Get Ragna!

26:23.420 --> 26:25.750
He fell in the river! He's still alive!

26:25.750 --> 26:27.080
Oh!

26:39.080 --> 26:40.670
How dare you...

26:40.670 --> 26:42.670
How dare you, how dare you!

26:42.670 --> 26:44.250
You've really done it now.

26:45.210 --> 26:47.210
You hurt my Ragna!

26:47.960 --> 26:49.380
I'll kill you!

26:49.880 --> 26:51.500
I'll kill you!

26:58.880 --> 27:00.630
I'm sinking...

27:03.670 --> 27:08.420
Deeper and deeper into that dream.

27:11.920 --> 27:14.580
After losing Leo,

27:14.580 --> 27:17.080
I begin my hell-bent quest for revenge...

27:18.960 --> 27:21.670
to hunt down every last dragon to extinction!

27:22.790 --> 27:25.130
I fight. I become powerful.

27:25.710 --> 27:27.960
I train to the full extent of my potential.

27:28.420 --> 27:29.920
But it won't be enough.

27:30.790 --> 27:33.960
I make new companions during battle.

27:34.960 --> 27:38.040
But even then, I lose them too.

27:40.790 --> 27:42.790
I lead a life of loss.

27:49.040 --> 27:51.210
But still, I continue fighting.

27:53.880 --> 27:55.080
To the limits...

27:56.000 --> 27:57.080
of my limits...

27:57.830 --> 27:58.920
of my limits!

28:06.630 --> 28:10.710
And then to the power
lying beyond even that limit!

28:18.750 --> 28:20.960
Looking back on it now,

28:22.290 --> 28:24.130
maybe I just wanted...

28:25.040 --> 28:27.790
a chance to die.

28:31.000 --> 28:33.330
But I didn't die.

28:33.920 --> 28:36.080
I always survived.

28:37.540 --> 28:38.830
This...

28:39.580 --> 28:41.420
This can't be!

28:43.580 --> 28:46.290
I'm your future.

28:46.830 --> 28:48.750
And you're my past!

28:51.670 --> 28:53.290
So you're...

28:55.580 --> 28:57.580
My future self?

28:59.080 --> 29:00.170
You...

29:00.880 --> 29:02.880
disgust me!

29:04.330 --> 29:08.580
You idolized a little girl as a hero
and leeched off her!

29:14.250 --> 29:17.290
If she were truly important to you,

29:17.830 --> 29:22.130
you should've became stronger than
everyone else in order to protect her!

29:25.170 --> 29:26.790
I'm strong now!

29:26.790 --> 29:28.210
Stronger than everyone.

29:28.210 --> 29:30.290
I can stand against dragon monarchs!

29:30.290 --> 29:33.750
Now, I can protect everything I've lost!

29:35.080 --> 29:36.540
But...

29:38.420 --> 29:42.040
But there's not a single thing left
for me to protect.

29:42.380 --> 29:43.710
What's the point of it?

29:43.710 --> 29:44.830
What does it matter?

29:44.830 --> 29:46.670
Why am I so strong?

29:46.670 --> 29:49.080
What's the benefit of being so strong now?

29:49.080 --> 29:50.630
In that case, then...

29:57.080 --> 29:59.290
Then give it to me!

29:59.540 --> 30:01.960
Now! The time's now!

30:05.080 --> 30:06.630
I need...

30:07.380 --> 30:09.630
that power right now!

30:15.630 --> 30:16.920
I know.

30:19.460 --> 30:21.290
That's what I was planning to do.

30:23.750 --> 30:24.830
Huh?

30:29.170 --> 30:32.580
Do you understand just how remorseful I felt

30:32.580 --> 30:36.830
that I wasn't as strong that day as I am now?

30:45.580 --> 30:46.670
What was that?

30:52.330 --> 30:57.040
From this moment on,
the past and the future are one.

30:58.580 --> 31:02.790
And I will now let all my power surge into you!

31:07.170 --> 31:09.710
He said there was a price to pay.

31:10.330 --> 31:12.710
I told him I didn't care.

31:13.670 --> 31:16.460
You'd say the same thing
in my shoes, wouldn't you?

31:23.330 --> 31:26.170
We'll shatter this future to pieces!

31:37.420 --> 31:39.040
How tenacious.

31:40.000 --> 31:41.790
Well, I'm a genius.

31:41.790 --> 31:43.750
You're pretty tough yourself.

31:44.210 --> 31:47.750
By any chance, are you
the Dragon God or something?

31:48.380 --> 31:50.580
What did you just say?

31:51.540 --> 31:56.000
You'd dare compare the lowly likes
of one such as I...

31:56.000 --> 32:00.290
to the mighty God of our bloodline?
You inferior animal!

32:06.880 --> 32:09.040
I am called Grymwelte.

32:09.040 --> 32:12.670
I am the Tenth Seat of
the Blood of the Wing.

32:12.670 --> 32:16.670
I'm the lowliest of what you humans
call superior dragons.

32:20.670 --> 32:25.000
I have an interesting tidbit to share
with you, foolish creature.

32:25.000 --> 32:30.670
The reason this city and then
this kingdom will be destroyed...

32:31.330 --> 32:34.500
is because the great God
our bloodline worships,

32:34.500 --> 32:37.380
relishes the confections
humans create as offerings.

32:39.380 --> 32:43.210
In particular, our God is...

32:43.210 --> 32:46.830
Er, I mean was, fond of a shop in Donapierru.

32:46.830 --> 32:51.330
Although our God was an immensely
loyal patron of this pastry shop,

32:51.330 --> 32:56.040
it was robbed and went
out of business the other day.

32:57.960 --> 33:03.960
Even though we, the Blood of the Wing, were
generously providing protection to the city!

33:04.420 --> 33:08.580
Our God was deeply
saddened by this and said,

33:09.500 --> 33:12.880
"Forget it. Lay waste to the kingdom."

33:13.170 --> 33:14.460
What?

33:14.460 --> 33:16.500
That's the reason why.

33:17.040 --> 33:23.420
The whims of our God decide
the fate of the human nations.

33:23.420 --> 33:27.080
Did you get the impression
this was a real battle?

33:27.080 --> 33:30.540
We never even bothered to take you seriously.

33:30.830 --> 33:34.670
Dragon hunters are no threat to our bloodline.

33:36.250 --> 33:39.670
Are you able to comprehend
your own insignificance now?

33:39.670 --> 33:41.670
Then die!

33:53.420 --> 33:55.080
An illusion?

33:55.080 --> 33:56.130
No!

33:58.040 --> 33:59.960
Something's coming?

34:06.920 --> 34:09.540
Wh-what the hell's going on?

34:29.420 --> 34:32.080
After I decided to exterminate dragonkind,

34:32.080 --> 34:34.210
I blindly pursued that goal.

34:39.830 --> 34:41.880
I almost died countless times.

34:43.250 --> 34:45.080
I survived over and over again.

34:45.670 --> 34:47.670
And then I fought again.

34:49.040 --> 34:52.960
And I lost and lost and lost and lost...

34:53.670 --> 34:56.920
and lost and lost and lost and lost and won...

34:56.920 --> 35:00.500
and lost and lost and lost and
lost and lost and won...

35:00.880 --> 35:03.750
and lost and lost and lost and won and lost...

35:03.750 --> 35:06.130
and lost and won and lost and won...

35:06.130 --> 35:09.750
and won and won and won and
won and won and won...

35:09.750 --> 35:11.710
and hunted dragons!

35:13.380 --> 35:15.580
I fought like that for ten years.

35:16.040 --> 35:18.880
Gradually, I realized my silver sword
was a part of me,

35:18.880 --> 35:22.170
and I was a part of my sword.

35:22.580 --> 35:25.250
My arm and silver sword became one.

35:25.250 --> 35:27.080
It was an eerie experience.

35:27.790 --> 35:30.790
But it didn't interfere with my dragon hunting.

35:31.170 --> 35:35.580
My body screamed in pain,
but I ignored it and continued to fight.

35:36.750 --> 35:40.790
Five years later, I was completely
fused with my silver sword.

35:42.210 --> 35:46.080
My body itself became a weapon
that radiated silverine.

35:46.960 --> 35:49.710
Then three years after that,

35:49.710 --> 35:53.500
I developed a technique that
increased my body's silverine.

35:53.880 --> 35:58.500
Four years after that, I learned
how to control silverine at will.

35:59.540 --> 36:01.790
After another ten years,

36:01.790 --> 36:04.880
I surpassed the limits of human ability,

36:04.880 --> 36:07.710
and I finally mastered
the ultimate battle technique.

36:07.710 --> 36:09.540
The pinnacle of dragon annhilation...

36:16.540 --> 36:19.920
Silverine Battle Arts.

36:34.500 --> 36:37.380
I know this sensation.

36:38.210 --> 36:41.130
It's the same sensation I feel
towards the dragon monarchs,

36:41.130 --> 36:45.630
those chosen by our God
to be leaders of the bloodlines.

36:47.250 --> 36:49.830
It's the terror and awe felt towards
a being possessing ultimate power.

36:52.040 --> 36:53.330
Impossible!

36:53.330 --> 36:54.880
Inconceivable!

36:54.880 --> 36:57.880
This cannot be!

36:58.960 --> 37:03.130
How could I fear a mere human?

37:03.380 --> 37:07.210
It cannot be so!

37:08.420 --> 37:13.830
Behold my true form and the magical
power of my blood at its full might!

37:13.830 --> 37:17.880
Only in this form is my
ultimate power unleashed!

37:17.880 --> 37:20.210
And that is-

37:20.670 --> 37:21.960
Freeze.

37:39.380 --> 37:40.500
Shatter.

38:17.040 --> 38:18.130
Ragna!

38:25.580 --> 38:29.920
How rueful I've felt for not having...

38:30.750 --> 38:33.080
the power I now possess on that day.

38:34.210 --> 38:35.750
How I longed to...

38:37.080 --> 38:39.130
How I longed to see you...

38:40.080 --> 38:41.580
once more!

38:42.420 --> 38:43.500
Huh?

38:55.830 --> 38:57.250
Leo...

38:58.000 --> 38:59.460
Leo!

39:14.080 --> 39:15.540
I survived.

39:16.500 --> 39:18.000
I'm alive.

39:20.130 --> 39:24.080
I'm sure you worked really,
really hard, didn't you?

39:25.790 --> 39:27.420
I didn't!

39:27.710 --> 39:31.210
The one who actually did
all the hard work wasn't me.

39:32.500 --> 39:36.710
But he's not here anymore!

39:39.250 --> 39:43.580
But I know his life story.

39:46.790 --> 39:49.830
I know how much he missed Leo.

39:50.790 --> 39:52.210
That's why...

39:55.630 --> 39:57.750
Thank you,

39:57.750 --> 39:59.170
Ragna.

40:09.080 --> 40:12.380
You died standing up, huh?

40:13.670 --> 40:17.080
I told you there was a price to be paid.

40:17.670 --> 40:20.880
The past you who's taking this on
won't live long either.

40:21.960 --> 40:23.580
Despite that...

40:25.130 --> 40:28.540
You have such a sentimental look on your face.

40:33.630 --> 40:35.830
We've been together for a long time,

40:35.830 --> 40:39.040
this is the first time I've see you
without a frown.

40:39.420 --> 40:40.750
Well, anyhow...

40:40.750 --> 40:42.750
Everything now hinges on the past.

40:44.710 --> 40:48.710
All our hopes of creating a world
where the dragons are naught...

40:49.830 --> 40:53.580
is entirely dependent on our past selves.

41:19.960 --> 41:23.880
On that day, seven of
Lese's cities were attacked.

41:24.960 --> 41:27.830
Six of those cities fell,
including the capital.

41:31.000 --> 41:32.830
On that very same day,

41:33.420 --> 41:37.580
the Reaper of dragonkind was born.

41:39.790 --> 41:42.170
All the dragons are gone,

41:42.170 --> 41:44.920
and the fires have subsided,

41:44.920 --> 41:46.790
but half the city has been destroyed.

41:46.790 --> 41:48.630
There were so many causalities.

41:51.580 --> 41:52.750
Leo.

41:53.040 --> 41:54.250
Hm?

41:54.540 --> 41:56.670
Leo, Leo!

41:57.040 --> 41:58.380
What?

41:59.290 --> 42:02.000
Leo, you're alive!

42:03.420 --> 42:04.960
Leo is...

42:07.130 --> 42:08.540
Ragna?

42:10.540 --> 42:11.960
It's nothing.

42:11.960 --> 42:13.250
Huh?

42:16.380 --> 42:19.380
What're you crying over? Freak.

42:20.330 --> 42:21.920
Sykes.

42:21.920 --> 42:24.250
Tch! That'd be Mr. Sykes to you.

42:24.250 --> 42:26.380
Why is Number Two here?

42:26.960 --> 42:29.540
What?! First of all, this is my house!

42:29.540 --> 42:33.580
You're the one who asked me to rent
a room to you since the inn burned down!

42:33.580 --> 42:34.710
Have some gratitude!

42:34.710 --> 42:35.960
Thank you.

42:36.920 --> 42:38.380
Shut it.

42:38.830 --> 42:39.960
So?

42:40.420 --> 42:42.210
What are you planning on doing?

42:42.960 --> 42:44.920
It'd be best to leave the country.

42:46.250 --> 42:49.630
The Dragon God demanded that
this kingdom be razed to the ground.

42:49.920 --> 42:52.330
The dragons treat their God's word as law,

42:52.330 --> 42:55.000
so they won't go after us
if we cross the border.

42:55.000 --> 42:58.380
Luckily, this city is close to the border.

42:58.380 --> 42:59.710
We need to move quick-

42:59.710 --> 43:01.250
Are you...

43:01.250 --> 43:02.960
really Ragna?

43:04.920 --> 43:10.210
The Ragna I know has no talent or skills
and doesn't have much brains either.

43:10.210 --> 43:12.380
He's a parasitic, shitty nobody!

43:12.630 --> 43:14.630
What the hell's going on?

43:14.630 --> 43:16.380
What happened back there?

43:23.080 --> 43:24.540
Answer me.

43:25.130 --> 43:27.920
Who are you?

43:28.670 --> 43:30.170
Answer me, Ragna!

43:31.670 --> 43:34.250
That... was...

43:38.540 --> 43:39.830
He fell asleep.

43:39.830 --> 43:41.710
Now of all times?!

43:45.880 --> 43:47.710
He can't help it.

43:47.710 --> 43:56.040
His power must be the result of him training
super hard when I wasn't watching.

43:56.670 --> 44:00.670
But it's draining him and making him unstable.

44:03.500 --> 44:04.630
Leo...

44:05.500 --> 44:06.670
Leo.

44:07.630 --> 44:08.750
Leo.

44:10.170 --> 44:11.670
It's all right.

44:12.210 --> 44:13.750
I'm right here.

44:14.880 --> 44:16.080
Leo...

44:19.630 --> 44:21.130
That's why...

44:24.670 --> 44:29.750
You still need me. Right, Ragna?

44:30.080 --> 44:32.630
Huh? What'd you just say?

44:33.040 --> 44:34.380
Nothing.

44:39.540 --> 44:42.290
Huh? Wh-what the hell?

44:54.210 --> 44:56.130
Th-the forest...

44:57.170 --> 45:00.170
The forest is attacking us!

45:06.250 --> 45:07.670
Come now,

45:07.670 --> 45:09.670
let our paths cross, Ragna.

45:10.750 --> 45:12.750
That's where this tale begins.
